{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And now, please stay here tonight.</b> In this place. <b>You too, tonight.</b> Therefore the Holy One, blessed be He, exacted retribution from Moab by night (Isaiah 15:1): ״כי בליל שודד ער מואב נדמה כי בליל שודד קיר מואב נדמה״ — corresponding to these two nights on which the messengers of Moab were sent to Balaam; thus did our Rabbis of blessed memory expound."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:35:00.483735384Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}